      "text": "Ohh, direct to the point, I like that. So for 5,000 calls a month, it actually depends on whether you are using just the outbound side or the full inbound and outbound intelligence suite. Can you tell me a little more about your current setup?",
      "timestamp": 1793420880.606352,
