      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "prospect",
      "text": "Got it, and how does the onboarding work? Can we start this week?",
      "timestamp": 1793420880.606352,
      "latency_ms": 0.0,
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "pearl",
      "text": "Haha, I see you're ready to move fast. That\u2019s great energy.\n\nFor 5,000 calls, we usually have a standard onboarding process that takes about two to three days to sync your CRM and train the AI on your specific tone and data. So yes, we can definitely start this week.\n\nDo you have your CRM credentials ready, or do you need help with that part?",
      "timestamp": 1793420880.968333,
      "latency_ms": 358.9999999385327,
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "prospect",
      "text": "Got it. How easy is it to integrate with our existing stack?",
      "timestamp": 1793420880.968333,
      "latency_ms": 0.0,
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "pearl",
      "text": "Honestly, it\u2019s quite seamless. Pearl AI has native integrations with most major CRMs and sales tools, so we don\u2019t have to build custom bridges. It\u2019s usually just a matter of connecting your existing accounts and mapping the fields.\n\nWhich CRM are you currently using? I can tell you exactly how quick the setup would be for that specific tool.",
      "timestamp": 1793420881.309415,
      "latency_ms": 344.0000000409782,
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "prospect",
      "text": "Got it. How easy is it to integrate with our existing stack?",
